code 'extract entities' :: (input: string) -> [Entity]:
```bpl
pragma(temperature=0.5, max_tokens=1024, model=context["text-davinci-003"])
# Task metadata
"task \"extract entities\"\n"
"Extract the distinct entities from the text\n"

# Task type instruction
"type None:"
"input: string\noutput: [Entity]"
"\n"

"type Entity:"
"name: string \"Canonical name of the entity\"\n'type': EntityType\nconfidence: number | null \"Confidence in the detected type\""
"\n"

# Task inference
"Perform the task extract entities as described above to complete the output with the correct types. Consider the instructions carefully:\n"
"Extract the distinct entities from the text\n"
" - The entities are distinct\n"
# Task type example stub
"The data should look like this (with real values obviously):\n"
"value example :: (input: string, output: [Entity]):\n"
"```\n"
"{\n  \"input\": \"lorem ipsum\",\n  \"output\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"lorem ipsum\",\n      \"type\": \"PER\",\n      \"confidence\": 42\n    }\n  ]\n}"
"\n```\n"

"value :: (input: string, output: [Entity]):\n"
"```\n"
"{\n"
"  \"input\": |{input}|,\n"
"  \"output\": |[final_output: [Entity]]|\n"
"}\n"
"```"
return final_output
```

